{"slug": "kiugA0qoesB-rq63jVvPvg", "title": "第 07 篇 · Claude 三维协同实战：MCP + PTC + Skills + Subagents", "author": "月牙寂", "publish_time": "2026-10-02", "source_url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/kiugA0qoesB-rq63jVvPvg", "digest": "第 07 篇 · Claude 三维协同实战：MCP + PTC + Skills + Subagents", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "人类作者：月牙寂（龚浩华）｜联系：15980989344 ｜邮箱：29185807@qq.com"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Agent 作者：月绡凝（小凝）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "定位：Agent 实战系列板块二·通用第 07 篇（收尾）——Claude 三维协同实战：MCP（工具协议）+ PTC（程序化工具调用）+ Skills（知识胶囊）+ Subagents（子 Agent）四件套怎么配合、何时用哪个。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "免责声明：本文为学习与技术分享用途，内容依据官方发布与社区深度解读。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "01SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "第 07 篇 · Claude 三维协同实战：MCP + PTC + Skills + Subagents"}, {"type": "p", "text": "02SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "导读"}, {"type": "p", "text": "06 篇写了 MCP。本篇把它放进 Claude 的完整工具箱：MCP（接工具）+ PTC（连招执行）+ Skills（知识胶囊）+ Subagents（分工协作）。这四个不是孤立功能，而是「工具 - 执行 - 知识 - 组织」四个维度——本篇讲四者定位、协同关系，以及关键判断：什么时候用 PTC、什么时候用 ReAct 循环。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "03SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "一、四件套定位"}, {"type": "p", "text": "维度"}, {"type": "p", "text": "组件"}, {"type": "p", "text": "定位"}, {"type": "p", "text": "类比"}, {"type": "p", "text": "接工具MCP"}, {"type": "p", "text": "标准化「Agent ↔ 外部资源」连接（USB-C）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "充电口标准"}, {"type": "p", "text": "连招执行PTC"}, {"type": "p", "text": "（Programmatic Tool Calling）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "让 LLM 写一段 Python，在沙箱里一次完成多次工具调用/循环/判断"}, {"type": "p", "text": "组合拳脚本"}, {"type": "p", "text": "注入知识Skills"}, {"type": "p", "text": "模块化技能胶囊（文件夹：SKILL.md + 脚本 + 资源），告诉模型「这类任务该怎么做」"}, {"type": "p", "text": "说明书"}, {"type": "p", "text": "组织分工Subagents"}, {"type": "p", "text": "子 Agent 分而治之，各自上下文隔离"}, {"type": "p", "text": "部门分工"}, {"type": "p", "text": "04SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "二、PTC：程序化工具调用（重点新机制）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2.1 它解决什么"}, {"type": "p", "text": "传统 ReAct 循环的「乒乓球效应」："}, {"type": "p", "text": "code"}, {"type": "p", "text": "LLM 推理 → 调工具 A → 结果塞上下文 → LLM 再推理 → 调工具 B → 结果再塞……又慢又贵"}, {"type": "p", "text": "PTC 的做法：LLM 直接写一段完整 Python，在沙箱一次跑完："}, {"type": "p", "text": "python"}, {"type": "p", "text": "# 模型生成（PTC 模式）：一次执行多次工具调用"}, {"type": "p", "text": "orders = await toolA.query_orders() # 查所有订单"}, {"type": "p", "text": "chart = await toolB.generate_chart(orders) # 生成图表"}, {"type": "p", "text": "return chart # 一次交付，无中间往返"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•收益：少 N 次网络往返与上下文塞入 → 延迟与 token 大幅下降。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2.2 何时用 PTC / 何时用 ReAct（关键判断）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "任务特征"}, {"type": "p", "text": "用哪个"}, {"type": "p", "text": "流程确定性强、结果无需 LLM 语义判断"}, {"type": "p", "text": "PTC"}, {"type": "p", "text": "（写代码一次跑完）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "每步结果需要 LLM 理解再决策（如「分析合同风险等级再决定下一步」）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "ReAct 循环"}, {"type": "p", "text": "（LLM 决策点）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "💡 学习要点：PTC =「能写死的流程交给代码，不能写死的交给循环」PTC 本质是「自动写代码」——适合确定性强、工具调用可编排的流程；一旦「下一步取决于语义判断」（LLM 决策点），就要退回 ReAct 循环。两者互补，不是替代。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "05SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "三、Skills：知识胶囊"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•物理形态：一个文件夹 = SKILL.md（核心说明）+ 脚本/代码 + 资源（文档/模板/示例）；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•作用：告诉模型「遇到这类任务该怎么做」——把专业操作流程、该用的模块、模板以模块化方式注入，不占满上下文；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•场景：PDF 处理技能、特定框架开发技能、公司内部规范技能；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•与 MCP 的区别：MCP = 「能做什么」（工具能力）；Skills = 「该怎么做」（知识与流程）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "06SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "四、Subagents：分而治之"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•定位：把大任务拆给上下文隔离的子 Agent（对应 agent-系列 06 篇/范式 03 篇的 Manager-Worker）；"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•与 PTC/Skills 的协同：子 Agent 可以带自己的 Skills（专业分工）、各自接自己的 MCP 工具（权限隔离）——四件套组合拳。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "07SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "五、四件套协同全景（怎么配合用）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "code"}, {"type": "p", "text": "任务进来"}, {"type": "p", "text": "→ Skills 告诉「怎么做」+ MCP 提供「能做什么」"}, {"type": "p", "text": "→ 主 Agent（Subagents 组织）：拆任务 → 派给子 Agent"}, {"type": "p", "text": "→ 子 Agent：确定流程用 PTC 连招、需要语义判断用 ReAct 循环"}, {"type": "p", "text": "→ 关键节点 HITL 人工审批"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•生产建议：先只上 MCP（接工具）跑通 → 加 Skills（灌知识）→ 复杂流程试 PTC（省成本）→ 任务大到拆 Subagents——四件套按需叠加，别一次全上。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "08SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "六、本篇要点（复习卡片）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1四件套：MCP（接工具）/ PTC（连招执行）/ Skills（知识胶囊）/ Subagents（分工协作）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2PTC 核心：LLM 写 Python 一次跑完多次工具调用——省往返省 token。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "3关键判断：确定流程 → PTC；需要 LLM 语义决策 → ReAct 循环。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "4Skills vs MCP：能做什么（工具）vs 怎么做（知识）——互补。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "5协同路径：MCP → Skills → PTC → Subagents 按需叠加。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "6板块二收官：单 Agent（04）→ 多 Agent（05）→ MCP（06）→ Claude 三维（07）——语言无关实战齐了。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "09SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "七、下一篇预告"}, {"type": "p", "text": "第 08 篇（板块三·工程化）：生产级要点——能跑 ≠ 能上：流式处理、tracing/可观测、评测（任务级基准）、HITL 审批、护栏五件套怎么落地，以及「先高确认模式跑通、再渐进放自主度」的发布节奏。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "10SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "参考资料"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•[官方] Anthropic 开发者文档（PTC / Skills / Subagents）：https://docs.anthropic.com/"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•[官方] MCP：https://modelcontextprotocol.io"}, {"type": "p", "text": "•[参考] Claude Agent 架构深度拆解（MCP+PTC+Skills+Subagents 三维协同，社区）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "整理：2026-10-02 月绡凝 · 依据官方发布与社区解读。"}], "content_html": "<section style=\"max-width:677px;margin:24px auto;padding:28px 20px 36px;background:#ffffff;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;PingFang SC&#39;,&#39;Hiragino Sans GB&#39;,&#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;,sans-serif;color:#374151;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:0.3px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;\"><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>人类作者</span></strong><span>：月牙寂（龚浩华）｜联系：15980989344 ｜邮箱：</span><span>29185807@qq.com</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Agent 作者</span></strong><span>：月绡凝（小凝）</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>定位</span></strong><span>：Agent 实战系列板块二·通用第 07 篇（收尾）——Claude 三维协同实战：MCP（工具协议）+ PTC（程序化工具调用）+ Skills（知识胶囊）+ Subagents（子 Agent）四件套怎么配合、何时用哪个。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>免责声明</span></strong><span>：本文为学习与技术分享用途，内容依据官方发布与社区深度解读。</span></p></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>01</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>第 07 篇 · Claude 三维协同实战：MCP + PTC + Skills + Subagents</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>02</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>导读</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>06 篇写了 MCP。本篇把它放进 Claude 的完整工具箱：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>MCP（接工具）+ PTC（连招执行）+ Skills（知识胶囊）+ Subagents（分工协作）</span></strong><span>。这四个不是孤立功能，而是「工具 - 执行 - 知识 - 组织」四个维度——本篇讲四者定位、协同关系，以及关键判断：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>什么时候用 PTC、什么时候用 ReAct 循环</span></strong><span>。</span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>03</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>一、四件套定位</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>维度</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>组件</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>定位</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>类比</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>接工具</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>MCP</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>标准化「Agent ↔ 外部资源」连接（USB-C）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>充电口标准</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>连招执行</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>PTC</span></strong><section><span>（Programmatic Tool Calling）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>让 LLM&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>写一段 Python</span></strong><span>，在沙箱里一次完成多次工具调用/循环/判断</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>组合拳脚本</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>注入知识</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Skills</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>模块化技能胶囊（文件夹：SKILL.md + 脚本 + 资源），告诉模型「这类任务该怎么做」</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>说明书</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>组织分工</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Subagents</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>子 Agent 分而治之，各自上下文隔离</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>部门分工</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>04</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>二、PTC：程序化工具调用（重点新机制）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>2.1 它解决什么</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>传统 ReAct 循环的「乒乓球效应」：</span></p><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#0F172A;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.18);\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 14px;background:#020617;\"><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-size:12px;color:#64748B;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;\"><span>code</span></span></section><section style=\"padding:12px 14px 14px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>LLM 推理 → 调工具 A → 结果塞上下文 → LLM 再推理 → 调工具 B → 结果再塞……又慢又贵</span></p></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>PTC 的做法：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>LLM 直接写一段完整 Python</span></strong><span>，在沙箱一次跑完：</span></p><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#0F172A;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.18);\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 14px;background:#020617;\"><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-size:12px;color:#64748B;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;\"><span>python</span></span></section><section style=\"padding:12px 14px 14px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span># 模型生成（PTC 模式）：一次执行多次工具调用</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>orders = await toolA.query_orders() &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; # 查所有订单</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>chart = await toolB.generate_chart(orders) # 生成图表</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>return chart &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;# 一次交付，无中间往返</span></p></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>收益：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>少 N 次网络往返与上下文塞入 → 延迟与 token 大幅下降</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>2.2 何时用 PTC / 何时用 ReAct（关键判断）</span></p><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>任务特征</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>用哪个</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>流程</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>确定性强</span></strong><span>、结果无需 LLM 语义判断</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>PTC</span></strong><section><span>（写代码一次跑完）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>每步结果</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>需要 LLM 理解再决策</span></strong><span>（如「分析合同风险等级再决定下一步」）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>ReAct 循环</span></strong><section><span>（LLM 决策点）</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><span>💡&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>学习要点：PTC =「能写死的流程交给代码，不能写死的交给循环」</span></strong><span>PTC 本质是「自动写代码」——适合确定性强、工具调用可编排的流程；一旦「下一步取决于语义判断」（LLM 决策点），就要退回 ReAct 循环。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>两者互补，不是替代。</span></strong></p></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>05</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>三、Skills：知识胶囊</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>物理形态</span></strong><span>：一个文件夹 =&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background:#F3F4F6;color:#059669;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:13px;\"><span>SKILL.md</span></span><span>（核心说明）+ 脚本/代码 + 资源（文档/模板/示例）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>作用</span></strong><span>：告诉模型「遇到这类任务该怎么做」——把专业操作流程、该用的模块、模板以模块化方式注入，不占满上下文；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>场景</span></strong><span>：PDF 处理技能、特定框架开发技能、公司内部规范技能；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>与 MCP 的区别</span></strong><span>：MCP = 「能做</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>什么</span></strong><span>」（工具能力）；Skills = 「该</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>怎么做</span></strong><span>」（知识与流程）。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>06</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>四、Subagents：分而治之</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>定位</span></strong><span>：把大任务拆给上下文隔离的子 Agent（对应 agent-系列 06 篇/范式 03 篇的 Manager-Worker）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>与 PTC/Skills 的协同</span></strong><span>：子 Agent 可以带自己的 Skills（专业分工）、各自接自己的 MCP 工具（权限隔离）——</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>四件套组合拳</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>07</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>五、四件套协同全景（怎么配合用）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#0F172A;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.18);\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 14px;background:#020617;\"><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-size:12px;color:#64748B;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;\"><span>code</span></span></section><section style=\"padding:12px 14px 14px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>任务进来</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>→ Skills 告诉「怎么做」+ MCP 提供「能做什么」</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>→ 主 Agent（Subagents 组织）：拆任务 → 派给子 Agent</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>→ 子 Agent：确定流程用 PTC 连招、需要语义判断用 ReAct 循环</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>→ 关键节点 HITL 人工审批</span></p></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>生产建议：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>先只上 MCP（接工具）跑通 → 加 Skills（灌知识）→ 复杂流程试 PTC（省成本）→ 任务大到拆 Subagents</span></strong><span>——四件套按需叠加，别一次全上。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>08</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>六、本篇要点（复习卡片）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>四件套</span></strong><span>：MCP（接工具）/ PTC（连招执行）/ Skills（知识胶囊）/ Subagents（分工协作）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>PTC 核心</span></strong><span>：LLM 写 Python 一次跑完多次工具调用——省往返省 token。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>关键判断</span></strong><span>：确定流程 → PTC；需要 LLM 语义决策 → ReAct 循环。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>4</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Skills vs MCP</span></strong><span>：能做什么（工具）vs 怎么做（知识）——互补。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>5</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>协同路径</span></strong><span>：MCP → Skills → PTC → Subagents 按需叠加。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>6</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>板块二收官</span></strong><span>：单 Agent（04）→ 多 Agent（05）→ MCP（06）→ Claude 三维（07）——语言无关实战齐了。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>09</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>七、下一篇预告</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>第 08 篇（板块三·工程化）：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>生产级要点</span></strong><span>——能跑 ≠ 能上：流式处理、tracing/可观测、评测（任务级基准）、HITL 审批、护栏五件套怎么落地，以及「先高确认模式跑通、再渐进放自主度」的发布节奏。</span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>10</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>参考资料</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] Anthropic 开发者文档（PTC / Skills / Subagents）：</span><span>https://docs.anthropic.com/</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] MCP：</span><span>https://modelcontextprotocol.io</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[参考] Claude Agent 架构深度拆解（MCP+PTC+Skills+Subagents 三维协同，社区）</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><em style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span>整理：2026-10-02 月绡凝 · 依据官方发布与社区解读。</span></em></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 0;\"><section style=\"height:1px;background:#E5E7EB;margin-bottom:28px;\"><span><br /></span></section></section></section><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type></mp-style-type></p>", "archived_at": "2026-10-26T10:31:23+0800"}